  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Misal kod, iskema JSON, e karallaaji politik ko masin nanata, ko yamiraama e ley Yamiroore MIT, si wonaa jaŋtaama goɗɗum. Aan ina waawi ɓamtude ɗum e lowreeji maa, alaa saɗteende.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Darorde jojjanɗi ndentiindi",
