  "Commercial use requires contact": "Huutoraade komersiyal ina ɗaɓɓi jokkondiral",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Winndannde ndee, nde yamiraa ɓaawo Fedde Cellal AI Bletchley, nde Yoshua Bengio ardii, e ballal ganndinooɓe ɓurɓe teemedere, ɓe ngoni leyɗe ɓadi cappanɗe tati, hade e UN, OECD, e EU, ina moɓɓina daliilaaji ganndal jaŋtaaɗi hannde fii peeñal AI dowrowɗi e kaake mum — ina jaŋta ko sabu juɓɓule ɗiɗi jooni ɗi waawi yiytude tuma ɗi ɓeɗtaa, ɗi waylita jikku majji e sabaabu mum.",
