  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Tabitannde vɛrsiyaandi, iskema JSON, e fiilaaji politik yaltinaaɗi tigi e lowre ndee. Kala fiilo ina waawi aawteede, goongɗineede, e jaŋtaneede feewi.",
