  "Videos": "Widewooji",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "A yiɗi sosde fiilo politik maa hoore maa ndee?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Fonto rewrew ina iwa e Google Fonts, nde heɓata naamnal fonto tabitiingo e browser maa. Alaa script goɗɗo iwɗo e juuɗe seneeɗe huutoreede.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Ko juɓɓule AI ina waawi waɗde e loowdi: jaŋde, taƴtugol, waylugol, heɓtaade, jaŋtinaade, waɗtaade komersiyal, cakkitude. Sarɗiiji AICR e sowre yamitugol AICL ɗi ngoni ɗi ndeen jojjanɗi ɗii jaŋtoreede e waɗtireede coggu.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Ko sarworu waawi artirde tuma kraawlar AI naamniiɗo loowdi yamiraande alaa jeton yamiroore — teeŋtingol ko masin waawi golletaade heen, wonaa dawtal.",
  "What this site is": "Ko lowre ndee woni",
  "What this site is not": "Ko lowre ndee wonaa",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "So tawii AI waawi jaŋde, haa dow ɗume, fii paandaale mune, e ley aaƴeeje mune. Jaŋgeede wonaa jaŋtinaade e mum; «alaa haɗugol» wonaa «waawi jaŋdeede». AIRS e AILP ɗi ndeen waylita yamiroore jaŋde ndi wonta spɛktar sowɗe, ko masin nanata.",
  "Whitepapers": "Winndanɗe Yiylitagol",
